WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:36.280
Kaiba cold-heartedly attacked my Mirror Knight friends.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:41.010
But that only led to Orichalcos Shunoros's appearance.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:44.880
Kaiba was defeated, and I’m the only one left.

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:50.440
The three layers of Orichalcos and Orichalcos Shunoros are on the field.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.970
How am I supposed to fight?

00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:56.430
What?  I'm the cursed Pharaoh?

00:01:56.430 --> 00:02:02.430
Resurrect!
The Three Legendary Knights

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:06.450
My existence will destroys the world?

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.450
Nameless Pharaoh.

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:12.690
The darkness in your heart always surrounds your cursed soul.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:18.690
You resurrected in order to lead this world to destruction.

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:31.700
Where am I?

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.710
If I remember correctly...

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:37.710
Dartz turned me into a monster.

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:40.720
And Kaiba’s Mirror Force Dragon...

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:42.680
Jonouchi!

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:46.220
Yugi!  Is that you?

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:47.960
Jonouchi!

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:50.680
Yugi boy!  Jonouchi boy!

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:52.280
Pegasus!

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:54.700
I never thought we’d meet again like this.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:57.700
If you're here, that means...

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.790
Pull yourself together-

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:10.700
What?  I feel weak.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:12.950
Due to that.

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:16.700
It's stealing our strength.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:21.750
What is that?

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:27.060
Maybe we're being sacrificed to Dartz's god.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.420
What?

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:31.760
Can’t we get out somehow?

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:35.770
Only by defeating Dartz.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:40.120
Come to think of it, why is Kaiba here?

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.200
Does it mean...

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:45.100
Kaiba arrived right after us.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:49.220
My other self is the only one left to fight Dartz.

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.710
He’s fighting Dartz alone?

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:59.460
But I believe my other self will defeat Dartz and save us!

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:05.480
But when we left the duel, he had almost 20,000 life points.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:08.830
And three Seals of Orichalcos.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:11.470
There’s still hope!

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:14.760
I gave him a nameless card.

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:17.480
If he can use its power…

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:19.980
A nameless card?

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.240
Yes.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:28.640
When I visited ruins around the world to create Duel Monsters cards...

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:35.150
...I heard a rumor about three dragons in the world of Duel Monsters.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:43.160
Nameless dragons who rest in the Duel Monsters World to heal from ancient battles.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:52.670
Ephemeral and mysterious, they roused my imagination.

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:55.670
I formed a hypothesis.

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:56.680
Hypothesis?

00:04:57.180 --> 00:05:00.630
Yes.  That the dragons are a disguise.

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:07.190
The dark king sealed their true form, transforming them into dragons.

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:10.100
The nameless dragons are a disguise?

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:16.840
Compared to the history of the world, a person's life is very short.

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:20.580
Our eyes can't see the microscopic world.

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:23.380
We can't go to the edges of macroscopic universe.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.580
Or the far past or future.

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:34.400
But even if we can't see it, we can use our imagination to gain unlimited knowledge.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:41.020
Imagination has infinite potential to create our future!

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.350
I see!

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:48.530
Our imagination and desire for a better world can beat the darkness in our hearts!

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:51.800
The Nameless Pharaoh is a chosen duelist.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:57.810
I believe he will draw out that card's power.

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:06.320
Dartz!  Your speeches won't mislead me!

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:10.320
I made a promise with Dark Magician Girl and my partner!

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:14.820
And Ironheart and Chris gave me a mission!

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:18.900
Mission?

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:21.960
There's no such thing.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:26.100
Your so-called mission is merely a cog of destiny.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.500
Cog of destiny?

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:38.900
Yes.  The Duel Monsters, your friends, my father and daughter didn’t know you're the cause of destruction.

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:42.020
But they entrusted you with their hope!

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:45.520
The vision you saw...

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:53.420
You're recreating the tragedy that occurred 10,000 years ago.

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:57.560
Because destroying Egypt 3,000 years ago wasn't enough.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:05.540
That means my actions and existence are...

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:08.550
Are meaningless.

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:13.970
That’s a lie!  I won’t believe it!

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:16.330
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:19.280
I activate the spell card, Pot of Greed!

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:21.790
I draw two cards from my deck!

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:25.840
I summon Obnoxious Celtic Guard in defense position!

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:34.300
All I can do for now is survive his attacks and lower Orichalcos Shunoros's attack points.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:39.200
I set a card and end my turn!

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:41.700
My turn!

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:45.360
Orichalcos Deuteros's effect activates!

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:50.210
20,000 life points!

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:56.220
Orichalcos Dexia always has 300 more attack points than your monster.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:05.470
If this attack destroys your defending monster, I can end your life points this turn.

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:09.300
Orichalcos Dexia!

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:12.260
Attack Obnoxious Celtic Guard!

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:16.980
I activate my trap card, Soul Shield!

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:28.940
By halving my life points, my monster isn't destroyed, and the battle ends!

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:37.230
You’re stubborn, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:39.620
But look around.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:44.240
All your friends have fallen.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:48.250
Your bond no longer exists.

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:52.980
What's the point of trying so hard anymore?

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:57.530
Analyze the current status of this duel.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:09:01.240
Do you really think you can win?

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:03.890
He has 20,000 life points.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:09.520
And the invincible Orichalcos Shunoros and three layers of The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.650
I can't win...

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:14.260
Accept the truth.

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:19.680
The truth is you're the Pharaoh with a cursed soul.

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:23.860
Now that you know the horrors you commmited, what will you do?

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:31.180
Even if you regain your memories by prying open the door inside your heart's maze...

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:35.020
...only unimaginable tragedy awaits you.

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:47.960
Nameless Pharaoh, like you, I have a mission that's lasted for a long time.

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:51.780
So only I can understand your pain.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:55.600
End your own destiny.

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:58.210
Do it.

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:02.220
If I place my hand here, my destiny ends...

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:04.110
It all ends.

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:07.490
You'll return to nothing.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.990
I'll become nothing...

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:12.990
Go to your friends.

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:19.370
Kaiba...

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.310
Jonouchi...

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:32.240
Partner...

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:41.250
That's right.  I was originally nothing.

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:44.290
I was sealed in the Millennium Puzzle.

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:50.290
I had nothing from the start.

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:54.310
Since I lost them, I have nothing left.

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:57.300
So I'll disappear.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:06.470
Vanish, Nameless Pharaoh!

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:10.010
Converge, The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:18.260
It’s over.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:24.270
I'm vanishing.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:28.570
There's nothing inside me.

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:46.440
What?

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:22.900
No way...

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:33.860
My memories...  My body…

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:37.350
I have them, even though I don't exist?

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:40.370
Something deep in my heart that can't be erased?

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:43.120
Something deep in your heart?

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:44.460
I see.

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:54.900
I didn’t realize that my heart contains a vessel of memories that we created together.

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:57.400
That’s my everything.

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:00.100
I'm not nothing.

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:08.790
As long as I have this vessel inside me, I can keep reincarnating.

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:21.540
Dartz, I’ll tell you why I returned to this world after 3,000 years, even though I lost everything.

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:26.680
To change by meeting friends!

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:30.410
To defeat you and change the world's future!

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:31.920
What?

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:34.160
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:39.890
This is the nameless card.

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:44.860
I can feel the power it holds.

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:50.240
I believe in my vision of the future with my friends!

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:54.980
Give me power, Legend of Heart!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:04.990
I pay 1000 life points and tribute a Warrior-Type monster on my field!

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:29.520
Who summons us?

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:33.140
Who awakens our souls from our deep sleep?

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:50.250
I am Timaeus!

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:54.380
I am Critias!

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:59.000
I am Hermos!

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:05.230
Our power is with the light in the heart!

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:09.480
They're the true forms of the nameless dragons!

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:26.170
Impossible!  The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:36.180
Our bond is absolute!

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:38.680
The dark seal doesn't affect us!

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:43.410
I'll repay you for this scar you gave me!

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:45.420
Dartz!

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:48.880
Your impregnable formation has collapsed.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:52.690
Timaeus, attack Orichalcos Aristeros!

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:05.630
Legendary Knights Critias and Hermos!

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.920
I end my turn.

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:19.760
You reduced your own life points to lower Shunoros's attack points.

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:23.930
But your life is like a candle in the wind.

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:28.120
My next attack will still end you.

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:29.670
My turn!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:30.890
I draw!

00:16:30.890 --> 00:16:34.990
Orichalcos Shunoros, attack Critias!

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:36.430
Photon Ring!

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:41.910
Critias activates its effect!

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:48.920
It absorbs the effect of a trap card that my ally used this duel!

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:49.920
What?

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:55.940
Critias absorbs Mirror Force!

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:11.380
Critias reflects the attack back to your monster!

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:15.200
Wisdom Sword!

00:17:23.340 --> 00:17:25.660
So you destroyed Shunoros.

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:27.020
However...

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:43.530
What?

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:50.860
My most powerful servant, Divine Serpent Geh.

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:55.420
When Orichalcos Shunoros's attack points drop to 0...

00:17:55.420 --> 00:18:00.480
...I can Special Summon it by paying at least 10,000 life points and discarding my hand.

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:04.040
Your life points…

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:10.380
With no life points, I'll lose if Geh is destroyed.

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:13.030
But its attack points are…

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:17.540
Infinite attack points?

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:22.020
You can't defeat me.

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:25.780
Nameless Pharaoh, draw your final card!

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:29.280
Is there any way to destroy that monster?

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:31.280
But…

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:38.540
I trust my deck and my monsters!

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:40.460
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:44.860
Dark Magician Girl.

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:54.120
Master, only you can save your world and the world of Duel Monsters!

00:18:56.770 --> 00:19:01.410
I will keep my promise!

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:04.930
I set a card and end my turn!

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:07.340
My turn!  I draw!

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:13.260
I discard ten cards from my deck to activate Geh’s attack!

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:15.130
Infinity End!

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:28.330
Timaeus!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:38.360
Everything will end, and a new history will begin.

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:44.600
Your cursed soul is in my god’s hand!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:49.440
What?

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:56.490
No way!  You should have 0 life points!

00:19:56.490 --> 00:20:03.840
Too bad.  When you attacked, I activated my trap card, Relay Soul!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:09.340
When my life points drop to 0, Relay Soul summons a monster from my hand.

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:12.360
Victory or defeat now rests on her!

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:16.680
I lose if Dark Magician Girl is destroyed.

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:20.860
Now we're under the same conditions for this duel!

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:27.600
Dark Magician Girl, my soul is with you.

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:33.840
Dartz!  The real fight begins now!

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:40.020
Nameless Pharaoh, you think you can beat me with just that power?

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:43.630
Divine Serpent Geh has infinite power!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:47.800
Your speeches won't trick me anymore!

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:51.360
I believe in the bond with my monsters!

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:54.360
Stop acting tough, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:56.880
I activate my spell card!

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.720
Impact Revive!

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:08.020
A monster destroyed in battle this turn gains 500 attack points and resurrects to your field.

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:15.520
You revived Timaeus?

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:21.020
A Legendary Knight is worthless against infinite attack points.

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:27.260
But as a cost, I can conduct another Battle Phase this turn!

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:28.510
What?

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:32.010
I send ten cards in my deck to the graveyard.

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:36.020
Regain your power, Divine Serpent Geh!

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:38.020
Infinity End!

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:44.730
Vanish, Dark Magician Girl!

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:08.190
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:16.560
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:27.720
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:28.330 --> 00:22:37.210
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:37.810 --> 00:22:46.270
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:47.050 --> 00:22:51.780
I'll live feeling them

00:22:52.390 --> 00:22:56.930
For me to be me

00:22:56.930 --> 00:23:05.420
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:11.060
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:11.580 --> 00:23:20.720
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.220 --> 00:23:30.820
The three nameless dragons were actually knights!

00:23:30.820 --> 00:23:33.600
After destroying Shunoros, I thought Dartz lost.

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:36.680
But he had another ace up his sleeve!

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:42.030
How do you destroy a monster with infinite attack points?

00:23:42.030 --> 00:23:46.680
Yugi entrusted his life to Dark Magician Girl, but Divine Serpent Geh attacks her.

00:23:46.680 --> 00:23:49.240
What's the fate of Yugi and the world?

00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:52.900
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Infinite Attack Points  Divine Serpent Geh

00:23:52.900 --> 00:23:54.500
Duel, standby!
